Install an exact local release, preserving seeds and rejecting edited managed files

Usage: empack instance install [OPTIONS] --sha256 <SHA256> <RELEASE>

Arguments:
  <RELEASE>  Immutable JSON release payload, not an author manifest

Options:
      --preserve <PATH>        Keep your file as a local override; use the path shown in the
                               conflict options
      --replace <PATH>         Use the release version of a conflicting file, or remove it if no
                               longer included
      --merge <PATH=FILE>      Use your prepared merged file as a local override
      --state-dir <STATE_DIR>  Durable operation and recovery storage, separate from disposable
                               caches [env: EMPACK_STATE_DIR=]
      --cache-dir <CACHE_DIR>  Disposable cache root; previews only inspect existing objects [env:
                               EMPACK_CACHE_DIR=]
      --sha256 <SHA256>        Expected SHA-256 of the exact release payload bytes
      --side <SIDE>            Infer the installed environment; first installation defaults to
                               client [possible values: client, server]
      --layout <LAYOUT>        Fixed content directory; retained on updates (new instances default
                               to game) [possible values: game, prism]
      --choice <KEY=VALUE>     Stable release choice and selected alternative
      --file <KEY=PATH>        Associate exact content with a release file key, including manual
                               downloads
  -y, --yes                    Run without prompts; unresolved content choices still fail [env:
                               EMPACK_YES=]
      --dry-run                Preview changes without publishing project, instance or durable state
                               [env: EMPACK_DRY_RUN=]
  -h, --help                   Print help
  -V, --version                Print version
